@mar22_services
title: Organise a funded local housing, schools and health amendment
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The policy team cannot assemble the package.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; refugee_settlement = "Funded local services proposal"; local_network += 4; health_policy_pressure += 3; household_policy_pressure += 2; psl_relation += 2; budget_promises += 1; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Opposition and local-government network"; last_policy_implementation = 0; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 10; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_salience += 8; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_left_ownership += 6; news_headline = "Emergency welcome becomes a local-service amendment"

Lewica mayors, PSL local governments and service unions assemble one amendment
for housing, additional school classes, primary care and interpreters. The
costing treats a Ukrainian child and a Polish pupil as users of the same school
rather than competitors for separate promises.

The network can document the need and organise delivery plans. Parliament and
the Council of Ministers must still provide the money.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@mar22_volunteers
title: Support the volunteer wave and postpone state design
subtitle: Keep the immediate reception alive while exhausting the people substituting for government.
on-arrival: refugee_settlement = "Volunteer emergency reception"; organiser_energy -= 5; refugee_service_capacity += 3; public_trust += 3; movement_autonomy += 2; household_security -= 1; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 8; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_salience += 6; news_headline = "Volunteers keep the reception system ahead of the state"

Party offices become storerooms, transport desks and temporary host registries.
The supplies move quickly because organisers ignore institutional boundaries
and solve the problem in front of them.

They also begin to burn out. Families make private commitments no budget has
replaced, and the government learns that applause for volunteers is cheaper
than designing a reception system.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@mar22_equal
title: Demand one humanitarian standard at both eastern borders
subtitle: Connect Ukrainian welcome to Belarusian-border law and reopen the security argument.
on-arrival: refugee_settlement = "One humanitarian standard"; minority_safety += 7; constitutional_restraint += 4; progressive_credibility += 3; border_security_confidence -= 2; far_right_agenda += 2; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 10; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 8; public_mood_pending_border_security_support -= 4; news_headline = "The Left links Ukrainian welcome to the Belarus frontier"

Lawyers and aid groups place the open reception of Ukrainians beside the
pushbacks still reported on the Belarusian frontier. Lewica demands that
nationality and the route of arrival cannot erase the right to seek protection.

The comparison restores a principle the emergency had obscured. Border officers
and security-minded voters reply that Lukashenko's operation and Putin's
invasion are not administered in the same conditions; PiS uses that difference
to avoid the legal question altogether.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@mar22_screen
title: Campaign for registration and security screening first
subtitle: Make an orderly state visible while risking suspicion toward people already welcomed by neighbours.
on-arrival: refugee_settlement = "Registration and screening proposal"; border_security_confidence += 5; military_trust += 2; minority_safety -= 3; psl_relation += 2; progressives_dissent += 4; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 9; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support -= 6; public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 5; news_headline = "Security screening defines the Left's refugee proposal"

Lewica asks the state to register arrivals, identify safeguarding risks and
give every host municipality a reliable count. PSL welcomes an orderly basis
for funding schools and clinics, and security officials gain a process they
can explain.

Leading with screening changes the emotional register of the welcome. Ukrainian
families who were received as neighbours now hear themselves described first
as a risk, and our progressive current makes that cost public.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue
